# Delver of Secrets (CR 701.27a, 712.8e): at the beginning of Bot1's turn-3 upkeep it looks at the top card, Lightning
# Bolt, and reveals it, so it transforms. The permanent is now Insectile Aberration, a 3/2 blue Human Insect with flying -
# the back face's characteristics alone, its color from its color indicator (CR 204) - whose mana value is still its front
# face's, 1 (CR 202.3b). The revealed card stayed on top (the 2011-09-22 ruling): Bot1 draws it that turn.

